.SS "void update_stat_color (GtkWidget * label, long value, long danger_low, long warn_low, long warn_high)"

.PP
Updates the font color of a GtkLabel depending on it's value and the specified thresholds\&. 
.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIlabel\fP The GTK Label to modify 
.br
\fIvalue\fP The value held by the label, to be evaluated against the thresholds 
.br
\fIdanger_low\fP Threshold value to put the danger class to the label\&. (value < danger_low) 
.br
\fIwarn_low\fP Threshold value to put the warn class to the label\&. (value < warn_low) 
.br
\fIwarn_high\fP Threshold value to remove the warn class to the label\&. (value > warn_high) 
.RE
.PP

